# The romance page's plain steps, moved word for word out of RomanceLines.cs, ConvoLines.cs and Conversation.Unified.cs.
# {act} hand | feelings | flirt | compliment | noticed | love | jealous | notnow | breakup | wary (what you did), {rname} who she is jealous of, {q} yes | no | again, love | plain for jealousy, date | confess | lunch | home | later for notnow (how she took it), {close} Lines.Closeness (2 = you are
# together), {lvl} for feelings gf | deep | friend | far, for her answer to a compliment looks | other, for yours effort | club | smart | looks, set in Conversation.Romance.cs with the old thresholds. Weights in
# {hook} the line you just said: flirt.share (what you feel, "Me too" answers it), flirt.praise (about her,
# never "Me too"), flirt.spend ("I really like spending time with you"); today | yesterday for a compliment again.

# ================= holding hands =================
@rule me.romance.hand.close
on me.romance
when act=hand close>=2
- Come here. Give me your hand.
- I missed holding your hand.
- Let's walk like this for a while.

@rule me.romance.hand.far
on me.romance
when act=hand close<=1
- Can I... hold your hand for a bit?
- Your hands look cold. Here.
- Would it be weird if I held your hand?

@rule romance.hand.yes.close.gentle
on romance
when act=hand q=yes close>=2 tone=gentle
- Mm... your hand is so warm. I could stay like this all day.
- Your hand is so warm... I don't want to let go.
- Mm... I feel safe like this.
- Holding your hand makes everything feel okay.
- Every time we do this my heart races like the first time...
- My heart still races every time...
- It's like the first time, every time...
- Even now, my heart jumps when you take my hand.

@rule romance.hand.yes.close.energetic
on romance
when act=hand q=yes close>=2 tone=energetic
- Hehe, fingers laced! That's the official couple grip!
- Laced fingers! Super official!
- Hand-holding power! Hehe!
- Swing, swing! Ehehe, I love this!
- Swing! Swing! Ahaha!
- Wheee! Hand swinging!
- Ehehe, this never gets old!
- Let's walk the long way so this lasts longer!
- Long way home! So this lasts longer!
- Let's take the scenic route! Hehe!
- Slow walk! Make it last!

@rule romance.hand.yes.close.cool
on romance
when act=hand q=yes close>=2 tone=cool
- ...Don't let go yet.
- ...Keep holding.
- ...Not yet. Don't let go.
- ...Stay like this.
- Your hand fits mine. Funny how that works.
- Your hand fits mine. Odd.
- ...We fit. Strange.
- ...It fits. I noticed.
- ...This is nice. Don't tell anyone I said that.
- ...This is pleasant. Keep that secret.
- ...Nice. Don't repeat that.
- ...I like this. Tell no one.

@rule romance.hand.yes.close.teasing
on romance
when act=hand q=yes close>=2 tone=teasing
- Squeeze back if you love me. ...Hm. Good answer.
- Squeeze if you love me. ...Correct.
- Squeeze twice if you're mine. ...Good.
- Prove it. Squeeze. ...Good boy.
- If you let go first, you lose. Got it?
- First to let go loses. Deal?
- Let go and you lose. Got it?
- Whoever lets go owes the other. Ready?

@rule romance.hand.yes.close.seen.gentle
on romance
when act=hand q=yes close>=2 watchers=one|few|crowd tone=gentle
- People are looking... but I don't mind. Not with you.
- Let them look... I'm happy with you.
- I don't care who sees. Not with you.
- People are staring... it's okay.

@rule romance.hand.yes.close.seen.energetic
on romance
when act=hand q=yes close>=2 watchers=one|few|crowd tone=energetic
- Look! We're holding hands! Everyone, look!

@rule romance.hand.yes.close.seen.teasing
on romance
when act=hand q=yes close>=2 watchers=one|few|crowd tone=teasing
- Holding hands in public? How bold. ...I'm not complaining.
- Public hand-holding? Scandalous. Keep going.
- Showing me off? Good.
- Brave, holding my hand here. I approve.

@rule romance.hand.yes.far.gentle
on romance
when act=hand q=yes close<=1 tone=gentle
- Eh...? O-okay... just for a little while...
- Eh...? O-okay... just a little...
- Ah... um... alright...
- Oh... okay... only for a bit...
- My face is so hot right now... please don't look...
- Please don't look at my face... it's so red...
- My cheeks are burning...
- D-don't look at me...
- It's... kind of nice, isn't it?
- It's nice, isn't it...?
- This feels... nice.
- I like this... a lot.

@rule romance.hand.yes.far.energetic
on romance
when act=hand q=yes close<=1 tone=energetic
- Whoa! Um. Okay! Sure! This is fine! Totally fine!
- Whoa! Okay! This is fine! Totally fine!
- Huh?! Sure! Yep! Hand! Okay!
- Ah! Um! Cool! Totally normal!
- Ahaha, my hand's all sweaty, sorry! ...Don't let go though.
- My hand's sweaty, sorry! Don't let go!
- Ahaha, so sweaty! Keep holding!
- Ugh, clammy! Still don't let go!
- Okay, this is kinda cute. Don't make it weird!
- Okay, this is cute! Don't ruin it!
- Kinda cute! No jokes!
- Aww, this is nice! Shh!

@rule romance.hand.yes.far.cool
on romance
when act=hand q=yes close<=1 tone=cool
- ...Fine. Your hand's warmer than I expected.
- ...Fine. Warm hand.
- ...Alright. Surprisingly warm.
- ...Acceptable.
- ...I suppose it's not unpleasant.
- ...Not unpleasant.
- ...I'll tolerate it.
- ...It's fine.
- Hm. Only until the end of the hallway.
- Only to the end of the hall.
- Until the corner.
- Briefly.

@rule romance.hand.yes.far.teasing
on romance
when act=hand q=yes close<=1 tone=teasing
- Oh? Taking the initiative today? ...I'll allow it.
- Taking the lead? I'll allow it.
- Oh? Bold today. Fine.
- My, how forward. Go on.
- Careful. If you hold on too long, I might not give it back.
- Hold too long and I'll keep it.
- Careful, I might not return it.
- Keep holding and it's mine.
- You're shaking a little. Nervous? How cute.
- You're trembling. Adorable.
- Nervous? Cute.
- Shaky hands? How sweet.

@rule romance.hand.no.gentle
on romance
when act=hand q=no tone=gentle
- Ah... s-sorry, not here... people might see...
- S-sorry... not here...
- Ah, people might see...
- N-not in front of everyone...

@rule romance.hand.no.energetic
on romance
when act=hand q=no tone=energetic
- Whoa, whoa! Hands to yourself, mister!
- Hands off, mister!
- Whoa, slow down!
- Nope! Not yet!

@rule romance.hand.no.cool
on romance
when act=hand q=no tone=cool
- No.
- Not now.
- Don't.

@rule romance.hand.no.teasing
on romance
when act=hand q=no tone=teasing
- Holding hands already? Earn it first.
- Earn it first.
- Too soon, sweetie.
- Not so fast.

# ================= how she feels about you =================
@rule me.romance.feelings
on me.romance
when act=feelings
- Can I ask you something? What do you think of me?
- Be honest. How do you see me?
- What am I to you, exactly?

@rule romance.feelings.gf.gentle
on romance
when act=feelings q=yes lvl=gf tone=gentle
- You're the most important person in the world to me. That's all.
- You're the most precious person to me.
- You mean everything to me.
- You're my most important person.

@rule romance.feelings.gf.energetic
on romance
when act=feelings q=yes lvl=gf tone=energetic
- You're my boyfriend, silly! The best one in the whole university!
- You're my boyfriend, dummy! The best one!
- Best boyfriend in the university! Easy!
- You're mine! Number one!

@rule romance.feelings.gf.cool
on romance
when act=feelings q=yes lvl=gf tone=cool
- You're the person I chose. I don't regret it.
- I chose you. No regrets.
- You're my choice. Final.
- I picked you. Correctly.

@rule romance.feelings.gf.teasing
on romance
when act=feelings q=yes lvl=gf tone=teasing
- You're mine. Isn't that obvious? Or do you just like hearing it?
- You're mine. Need me to say it again?
- Mine. Obviously. Like hearing it?
- You belong to me. Isn't it clear?

@rule romance.feelings.deep.gentle
on romance
when act=feelings q=yes lvl=deep tone=gentle
- I... I think about you a lot. More than I should, maybe...
- I think about you... a lot. Maybe too much.
- You're on my mind so often...
- I can't stop thinking about you...

@rule romance.feelings.deep.energetic
on romance
when act=feelings q=yes lvl=deep tone=energetic
- Honestly? You're kind of my favorite person right now. Don't let it go to your head!
- You're kinda my favorite person! Don't get cocky!
- Top person right now? You! Shh!
- Honestly, you're the best! Don't tell!

@rule romance.feelings.deep.cool
on romance
when act=feelings q=yes lvl=deep tone=cool
- You're... important to me. More than I planned.
- You matter to me. More than planned.
- You're... important. Unexpectedly.
- More important than I intended.

@rule romance.feelings.deep.teasing
on romance
when act=feelings q=yes lvl=deep tone=teasing
- Hmm... let's just say if you asked me out, I wouldn't say no right away.
- If you asked me out, I might say yes. Might.
- Ask me out sometime. Maybe I'll agree.
- Let's say I wouldn't refuse a date.

@rule romance.feelings.friend.gentle
on romance
when act=feelings q=yes lvl=friend tone=gentle
- You're a really good friend. I'm glad we met.
- You're a wonderful friend.
- I'm so glad we're friends.
- I'm happy I met you.

@rule romance.feelings.friend.energetic
on romance
when act=feelings q=yes lvl=friend tone=energetic
- You're super fun to be around! Like, top three people, easy!
- You're SO fun! Top three, easy!
- Best friend material!
- Hanging with you rocks!

@rule romance.feelings.friend.cool
on romance
when act=feelings q=yes lvl=friend tone=cool
- You're reliable. I like that.
- You're dependable.
- You're reliable. Good.
- I trust you.

@rule romance.feelings.friend.teasing
on romance
when act=feelings q=yes lvl=friend tone=teasing
- You're interesting. That's rare around here. Keep it up.
- You're interesting. That's rare.
- Not boring. I like that.
- You're fun. Keep it up.

@rule romance.feelings.far.gentle
on romance
when act=feelings q=yes lvl=far tone=gentle
- Um... you seem nice? I don't know you that well yet...
- You seem nice...? I don't know you well yet...
- Um... I need to know you more...
- I'm not sure yet... you seem kind.

@rule romance.feelings.far.energetic
on romance
when act=feelings q=yes lvl=far tone=energetic
- Hmm, you're okay! We should hang out more, then I'll tell you!
- You're okay! Hang out more and I'll decide!
- Jury's out! Let's chill sometime!
- Hmm! Ask me later!

@rule romance.feelings.far.cool
on romance
when act=feelings q=yes lvl=far tone=cool
- I don't have an opinion yet.
- No opinion yet.
- Undecided.
- Insufficient data.

@rule romance.feelings.far.teasing
on romance
when act=feelings q=yes lvl=far tone=teasing
- Ask me again when you've done something worth talking about.
- Do something interesting first.
- Impress me, then ask.
- Ask again later.

@rule romance.feelings.no.gentle
on romance
when act=feelings q=no tone=gentle
- Eh? We... don't really know each other that well yet...
- We don't know each other well yet...
- Um... that's a bit soon...
- Eh? We just met...

@rule romance.feelings.no.energetic
on romance
when act=feelings q=no tone=energetic
- Whoa, that's a big question! Ask me again later, okay?
- Big question! Later!
- Whoa! Ask later!
- That's a lot! Later!

@rule romance.feelings.no.cool
on romance
when act=feelings q=no tone=cool
- ...That's a strange thing to ask so soon.
- ...Strange to ask so soon.
- ...Premature.
- ...Too early.

@rule romance.feelings.no.teasing
on romance
when act=feelings q=no tone=teasing
- Already? Slow down, hotshot.
- Slow down, hotshot.
- Already? Easy.
- Whoa, eager.

# ================= being sweet =================
@rule me.romance.flirt.close.share
on me.romance
when act=flirt close>=2
hook flirt.share
- I was looking forward to seeing you all day.
- You're the best part of my day, you know.
- Being with you is my favorite thing.
- I keep thinking about our last date.
- I'd skip every class just to sit here with you.

@rule me.romance.flirt.close.praise
on me.romance
when act=flirt close>=2
hook flirt.praise
- You look cute when you're thinking hard about something.

@rule me.romance.flirt.far.spend
on me.romance
when act=flirt close<=1
hook flirt.spend
- I really like spending time with you.

@rule me.romance.flirt.far.praise
on me.romance
when act=flirt close<=1
hook flirt.praise
- You're kind of amazing, you know that?
- Your laugh is really cute.

@rule me.romance.flirt.far.share
on me.romance
when act=flirt close<=1
hook flirt.share
- Talking to you always cheers me up.
- I'm glad I met you.
- I find myself looking for you in the hallway.

@rule romance.flirt.yes.close.gentle
on romance
when act=flirt q=yes close>=2 tone=gentle
- You always know what to say... I love that about you.
- You always know what to say... I love it.
- You're so sweet... I love that.
- Your words make me happy...

@rule romance.flirt.yes.close.share.gentle
on romance
when act=flirt q=yes close>=2 hook=flirt.share|flirt.spend tone=gentle
- M-me too... I'm so happy you said that.
- M-me too... I'm so happy.
- I feel the same...
- Me too... really.

@rule romance.flirt.yes.close.energetic
on romance
when act=flirt q=yes close>=2 tone=energetic
- Ehehe! I'm the luckiest girl on campus!
- Luckiest girl on campus!
- I'm so lucky!
- Best boyfriend ever!

@rule romance.flirt.yes.close.share.energetic
on romance
when act=flirt q=yes close>=2 hook=flirt.share|flirt.spend tone=energetic
- Aww! You're making me blush! Me too, okay?!
- Me too! Stop, I'm blushing!
- Aww! Same!
- Me too, okay?!

@rule romance.flirt.yes.close.cool
on romance
when act=flirt q=yes close>=2 tone=cool
- I like this. Us.
- I like us.
- This is good.
- I like this.

@rule romance.flirt.yes.close.share.cool
on romance
when act=flirt q=yes close>=2 hook=flirt.share|flirt.spend tone=cool
- ...Me too. Don't make me say it twice.
- ...Same. Once only.
- ...Me too.
- ...Likewise. Don't repeat it.

@rule romance.flirt.yes.close.teasing
on romance
when act=flirt q=yes close>=2 tone=teasing
- Keep talking like that and I might fall for you all over again.
- Keep it up and I'll fall again.
- Careful. I'm falling again.
- More, and I'm yours all over again.

@rule romance.flirt.yes.close.share.teasing
on romance
when act=flirt q=yes close>=2 hook=flirt.share|flirt.spend tone=teasing
- Hmph. Smooth talker. ...I feel the same.
- Smooth. ...Same.
- Charmer. ...Me too.
- Hmph. ...Me too.

@rule romance.flirt.yes.far.gentle
on romance
when act=flirt q=yes close<=1 tone=gentle
- That's... a really nice thing to say.
- That's so nice...
- What a kind thing...
- That's lovely...

@rule romance.flirt.yes.far.spend.gentle
on romance
when act=flirt q=yes close<=1 hook=flirt.spend tone=gentle
- Eh...? I-I like spending time with you too...
- I-I like being with you too...

@rule romance.flirt.yes.far.share.gentle
on romance
when act=flirt q=yes close<=1 hook=flirt.share|flirt.spend tone=gentle
- Eh...? Me too...
- I enjoy our time too...

@rule romance.flirt.yes.far.energetic
on romance
when act=flirt q=yes close<=1 tone=energetic
- Wh-whoa, where did that come from?! ...Thanks, hehe.
- Whoa! ...Thanks, hehe.
- Where'd that come from?! ...Hehe.
- Wh-what?! ...Thanks!
- Haha, you're so straightforward! I like it!
- So direct! I like it!
- Straightforward! Nice!
- Ha! Honest! Love it!

@rule romance.flirt.yes.far.cool
on romance
when act=flirt q=yes close<=1 tone=cool
- ...You're making me lose my composure.
- ...You're rattling me.
- ...My composure. Gone.
- ...Stop. I'm flustered.
- ...I don't dislike hearing that.
- ...I don't mind it.
- ...Not unpleasant.
- ...Fine to hear.

@rule romance.flirt.yes.far.teasing
on romance
when act=flirt q=yes close<=1 tone=teasing
- Oh my. Are you trying to make me blush?
- Making me blush?
- Oh my. Trying to fluster me?
- Is that a blush attempt?
- Careful. I might start believing you.
- I might believe you. Careful.
- Don't make me believe it.
- Dangerous words.

@rule romance.flirt.no.gentle
on romance
when act=flirt q=no tone=gentle
- Um... we don't know each other that well yet...
- We don't know each other well yet...
- Um... too soon...
- I'm not ready for that...

@rule romance.flirt.no.energetic
on romance
when act=flirt q=no tone=energetic
- Whoa, slow down there, buddy!
- Whoa, slow down!
- Easy there!
- Too fast, buddy!

@rule romance.flirt.no.cool
on romance
when act=flirt q=no tone=cool
- ...That's a bit much.
- ...Too much.
- ...Excessive.
- ...Slow down.

@rule romance.flirt.no.teasing
on romance
when act=flirt q=no tone=teasing
- Nice try. You'll have to work harder than that.
- Try harder.
- Not that easy.
- Nice try.

@rule romance.flirt.again.gentle
on romance
when act=flirt q=again tone=gentle
- Y-you already said something like that...
- Y-you said that already...
- Ah... again? You're making me blush...
- Um... I heard you the first time...

@rule romance.flirt.again.energetic
on romance
when act=flirt q=again tone=energetic
- Okay, okay, I get it! Hehe!
- Okay, okay! I heard you! Ehehe!
- Again?! Alright, I get it!
- Haha, you're repeating yourself!

@rule romance.flirt.again.cool
on romance
when act=flirt q=again tone=cool
- Once is enough.
- You said that.
- I heard you the first time.
- Once was sufficient.

@rule romance.flirt.again.teasing
on romance
when act=flirt q=again tone=teasing
- Laying it on thick, aren't you?
- Running out of material?
- Again? Someone's desperate.
- Twice in a row? Try harder.

# ================= with people around, and when she needed to hear it =================
@rule romance.hand.yes.watched.gentle
on romance
when act=hand q=yes close>=2 watchers=few|crowd tone=gentle
- [Everyone can see us...|They're all looking...] [I'm a little embarrassed, but I won't let go.|It's okay. I'm proud to be with you.]
- [Um, people are watching...|I can feel them looking...] [Hold on tight, then.|Just don't let go, okay?]
- [So many people...|In front of everyone...] [My face must be red.|I'm happy anyway.]

@rule romance.hand.yes.watched.energetic
on romance
when act=hand q=yes close>=2 watchers=few|crowd tone=energetic
- [Everybody's looking!|We've got an audience!] [Good! Let them!|Wave, wave! Hehe!]
- [Ooh, people are staring!|Hey, they noticed us!] [That's right, this one's mine!|Bet they're jealous!]
- [Look at all these people!|So many eyes on us!] [Hold tighter, make it official!|Ehehe, this is great!]

@rule romance.hand.yes.watched.cool
on romance
when act=hand q=yes close>=2 watchers=few|crowd tone=cool
- [...People are looking.|...We're being watched.] [Let them.|It doesn't matter.]
- [...An audience.|...Everyone can see.] [I don't care.|Fine by me.]
- [...They're staring.|...Hm. Eyes on us.] [Keep walking.|Don't let go because of them.]

@rule romance.hand.yes.watched.teasing
on romance
when act=hand q=yes close>=2 watchers=few|crowd tone=teasing
- [Everyone's watching, you know.|We have an audience~] [Let them look.|Smile for them.]
- [All these eyes on us~|Look who's staring.] [Let them be jealous.|I like it.]
- [Showing me off in front of everyone?|In front of all these people?] [Bold. I approve.|Good choice~]

@rule romance.hand.no.watched.gentle
on romance
when act=hand q=no watchers=few|crowd tone=gentle
- [N-not with everyone here...|There are so many people...] [I'm sorry.|Maybe when we're alone?]
- [Um, they'd all see...|People are right there...] [I'm too embarrassed.|Not here, please.]
- [Ah, wait...|S-sorry...] [Everyone's looking.|Not in front of them.]

@rule romance.hand.no.watched.energetic
on romance
when act=hand q=no watchers=few|crowd tone=energetic
- [Whoa, in front of everyone?!|Hey, people are right there!] [No way!|Not a chance!]
- [Nope! Too many witnesses!|Are you kidding? Look around!] [Try somewhere else!|Maybe another time!]
- [Ahaha, not here!|Hold on, hold on!] [They'd never let me hear the end of it!|People talk, you know!]

@rule romance.hand.no.watched.cool
on romance
when act=hand q=no watchers=few|crowd tone=cool
- [...Not in front of them.|...There are people here.] [No.|Don't.]
- [...Look around first.|...Think.] [Not here.|We're being watched.]
- [...No audience.|...I don't perform.] [Hands down.|Not now.]

@rule romance.hand.no.watched.teasing
on romance
when act=hand q=no watchers=few|crowd tone=teasing
- [With everyone watching?|In front of all these people?] [Nice try.|Cute, but no.]
- [An audience, and that's your move?|So public~] [Not a chance.|Try somewhere quieter.]
- [Oh, no no.|Mm-mm.] [Not here.|Everyone would talk.]

@rule romance.flirt.yes.needed.gentle
on romance
when act=flirt q=yes mood=lonely|upset|stressed tone=gentle
- [Thank you...|Oh...] [I really needed to hear that today.|That helps more than you know.]
- [You always notice...|I was having a hard day...] [Thank you for saying that.|You made it better.]
- [Today wasn't easy...|I was feeling a little down...] [but you made me smile.|and now I feel lighter.]

@rule romance.flirt.yes.needed.energetic
on romance
when act=flirt q=yes mood=lonely|upset|stressed tone=energetic
- [Hey, perfect timing!|Oh man, thanks!] [Today was rough!|I needed that!]
- [Ahaha, you just saved my day!|Okay, that actually helped!] [You're the best!|I owe you one!]
- [Today was the worst, but...|Ugh, what a day, but...] [that made it way better!|you fixed it, hehe!]

@rule romance.flirt.yes.needed.cool
on romance
when act=flirt q=yes mood=lonely|upset|stressed tone=cool
- [...Today was difficult.|...It's been a long day.] [That helped.|I'm glad you said that.]
- [...Good timing.|...Hm.] [I needed that.|Thank you.]
- [...I won't pretend that didn't help.|...You noticed.] [Don't stop.|Thanks.]

@rule romance.flirt.yes.needed.teasing
on romance
when act=flirt q=yes mood=lonely|upset|stressed tone=teasing
- [Trying to cheer me up?|Oh, you noticed?] [...It's working.|Fine, it's working.]
- [Today was awful, you know.|I was in a terrible mood.] [Lucky you came along.|You just fixed that~]
- [Hmph. Good timing.|You picked the right day.] [I'll let you stay.|Keep talking.]

# ================= compliments =================
@rule romance.compliment.yes.looks.gentle
on romance
when act=compliment q=yes lvl=looks tone=gentle
- Eh?! Y-you think so...? Thank you...
- Eh?! Really...? Thank you...
- Y-you think so? Thanks...
- Ah... thank you...!

@rule romance.compliment.yes.looks.energetic
on romance
when act=compliment q=yes lvl=looks tone=energetic
- Hehe, really?! You noticed!
- Really?! You noticed!
- Hehe! Thanks!
- You saw?! Yay!

@rule romance.compliment.yes.looks.cool
on romance
when act=compliment q=yes lvl=looks tone=cool
- ...You're not bad yourself. Thanks.
- ...You're not bad either.
- ...Thanks. You too.
- ...Likewise. Thanks.

@rule romance.compliment.yes.looks.teasing
on romance
when act=compliment q=yes lvl=looks tone=teasing
- Oh? Took you long enough to notice.
- Took you long enough.
- Finally noticed?
- Slow, but okay.

@rule romance.compliment.yes.other.gentle
on romance
when act=compliment q=yes lvl=other tone=gentle
- R-really? That makes me really happy...
- Really? I'm so happy...
- That makes me glad...
- Oh... thank you so much...

@rule romance.compliment.yes.other.energetic
on romance
when act=compliment q=yes lvl=other tone=energetic
- Yay! Somebody noticed!
- Someone noticed! Yay!
- Woo! Noticed!
- Finally! Yay!

@rule romance.compliment.yes.other.cool
on romance
when act=compliment q=yes lvl=other tone=cool
- ...Thank you. I appreciate that.
- ...Thank you.
- ...Appreciated.
- ...Thanks.

@rule romance.compliment.yes.other.teasing
on romance
when act=compliment q=yes lvl=other tone=teasing
- Finally, someone with taste.
- Good taste. Finally.
- Someone with eyes.
- At last, taste.

@rule romance.compliment.no.gentle
on romance
when act=compliment q=no tone=gentle
- Oh... um, thank you, I guess.
- Oh... thanks, I guess.
- Um... thank you?
- Ah... okay, thanks.

@rule romance.compliment.no.energetic
on romance
when act=compliment q=no tone=energetic
- Haha, thanks? Random, but okay!
- Thanks? Random!
- Ha! Okay, thanks!
- Huh? Thanks!

@rule romance.compliment.no.cool
on romance
when act=compliment q=no tone=cool
- Okay.
- Fine.
- Noted.

@rule romance.compliment.no.teasing
on romance
when act=compliment q=no tone=teasing
- Flattery won't get you far with me.
- Flattery won't work.
- Nice try.
- Not that easy.

@rule romance.compliment.again.gentle
on romance
when act=compliment q=again tone=gentle
- You said that before...
- That again...?

@rule romance.compliment.again.energetic
on romance
when act=compliment q=again tone=energetic
- You already told me! Got a new one?
- Heard it! New one!
- Old news!
- You already said!

@rule romance.compliment.again.cool
on romance
when act=compliment q=again tone=cool
- You're repeating yourself.
- Repeating.
- Same line.
- Again?

@rule romance.compliment.again.teasing
on romance
when act=compliment q=again tone=teasing
- Running out of material?
- Out of material?
- Rerun?
- Recycling?

@rule romance.compliment.again.today.gentle
on romance
when act=compliment q=again hook=today tone=gentle
- You already said that today...
- You told me earlier today...

@rule romance.compliment.again.yesterday.gentle
on romance
when act=compliment q=again hook=yesterday tone=gentle
- You said that yesterday too...
- You told me yesterday...

@rule romance.noticed.yes.gentle
on romance
when act=noticed q=yes tone=gentle
- Y-you noticed that? ...Thank you.
- You noticed...? Thank you.
- Oh... you saw that? Thanks.
- Ah... thank you for noticing.

@rule romance.noticed.yes.energetic
on romance
when act=noticed q=yes tone=energetic
- You noticed?! That makes me so happy!
- You noticed?! Yay!
- You saw?! Happy!
- No way! You noticed!

@rule romance.noticed.yes.cool
on romance
when act=noticed q=yes tone=cool
- ...You pay attention. I like that.
- ...Observant. Good.
- ...You noticed. Good.
- ...Attentive.

@rule romance.noticed.yes.teasing
on romance
when act=noticed q=yes tone=teasing
- Oh? Someone's been watching me~
- Watching me?
- Someone's been looking~
- Noticed, did you?

@rule romance.noticed.no.gentle
on romance
when act=noticed q=no tone=gentle
- Um... thanks, I guess?
- Um... thanks?
- Oh... thank you?
- Ah... okay, thanks.

@rule romance.noticed.no.energetic
on romance
when act=noticed q=no tone=energetic
- Oh, uh, thanks!
- Uh, thanks!
- Oh! Thanks!
- Huh, thanks!

@rule romance.noticed.no.cool
on romance
when act=noticed q=no tone=cool
- ...Okay.
- ...Hm.
- ...Alright.

@rule romance.noticed.no.teasing
on romance
when act=noticed q=no tone=teasing
- ...Where's this coming from?
- ...Why?
- ...Random.
- ...Okay?

# ================= talking about love =================
@rule romance.love.close.gentle
on romance
when act=love close>=2 tone=gentle
- Being your girlfriend... I still can't believe it sometimes.
- I still can't believe I'm your girlfriend...
- Being your girlfriend feels like a dream...
- Your girlfriend... it still surprises me.

@rule romance.love.close.energetic
on romance
when act=love close>=2 tone=energetic
- Everyone's jealous of us, you know! Hehe!
- Everyone envies us! Hehe!
- We're the university's couple!
- People are so jealous!

@rule romance.love.close.cool
on romance
when act=love close>=2 tone=cool
- I've been thinking about where we could go on our next date.
- I've been planning our next date.
- Next date ideas. I have some.
- Where shall we go next?

@rule romance.love.close.teasing
on romance
when act=love close>=2 tone=teasing
- So, what's the plan for our next date? It better be good.
- Next date plan? Make it good.
- Our next date. Impress me.
- Plan something good. Next date.

@rule romance.love.far.gentle
on romance
when act=love close<=1 tone=gentle
- Do you... have someone you like?
- Is there... someone you like?
- Do you like anyone...?
- Um... anyone special?

@rule romance.love.far.energetic
on romance
when act=love close<=1 tone=energetic
- So! Do you have a crush on anyone? Tell me!
- Crush! Who?! Tell me!
- Got a crush?! Spill!
- Who do you like?! Tell!

@rule romance.love.far.cool
on romance
when act=love close<=1 tone=cool
- Have you ever been in love?
- Ever been in love?
- Love. Experienced it?
- Have you loved someone?

@rule romance.love.far.teasing
on romance
when act=love close<=1 tone=teasing
- Who do you like? Come on, I won't tell.
- Who's your crush? I'll keep it secret.
- Spill. Who do you like?
- Your crush. Tell. I won't tell.

# ================= you spend too much time with someone else =================
@rule romance.jealous.love.gentle
on romance
when act=jealous q=love tone=gentle
- You and {rname} looked really happy together... I'm happy for you. I think.
- You and {rname} looked so happy... I'm glad. I think.
- You seem close to {rname}... that's nice. Probably.
- {rname} makes you smile... I'm happy for you. Mostly.
- I keep thinking about you and {rname}... Sorry, that's weird of me.
- I keep thinking about you and {rname}... sorry.
- You and {rname}... it's on my mind. Sorry.
- I can't stop thinking about you two... sorry.

@rule romance.jealous.love.energetic
on romance
when act=jealous q=love tone=energetic
- Hey! Why is it always {rname}?! What does she have that I don't?!
- Why {rname}?! What's she got that I don't?!
- {rname} again?! Not fair!
- Always {rname}! What about me?!
- I saw you with {rname} again! I'm not jealous! ...Okay, a little!
- You and {rname} again! Not jealous! ...A bit!
- {rname} again?! I'm fine! ...Kinda not!
- Saw you with {rname}! Totally fine! ...No!

@rule romance.jealous.love.cool
on romance
when act=jealous q=love tone=cool
- You've been with {rname} a lot. I noticed. That's all I'll say.
- You and {rname}. A lot lately. Noted.
- {rname}, often. I see.
- I've noticed you and {rname}. That's all.
- If you like {rname}, just say it. Don't keep me guessing.
- If it's {rname}, say so.
- Just tell me if it's {rname}.
- Be honest about {rname}.

@rule romance.jealous.love.teasing
on romance
when act=jealous q=love tone=teasing
- So {rname} gets your attention now? I can be much more fun, you know~
- {rname} has you now? I'm more fun~
- Choosing {rname}? I'm better~
- {rname}? I'm way more entertaining~
- Careful. If you keep spending time with {rname}, I might have to steal you back~
- Keep it up with {rname} and I'll steal you back~
- Careful. I'll take you from {rname}~
- {rname} can't keep you forever~

@rule romance.jealous.plain.gentle
on romance
when act=jealous q=plain tone=gentle
- You've been spending a lot of time with {rname} lately... it's fine. I just noticed, that's all.
- You're with {rname} a lot lately... it's okay. I just noticed.
- So much time with {rname}... it's fine, really.
- I see you with {rname} a lot... that's all.
- Um... did I do something wrong? You only talk to {rname} these days.
- Did I do something wrong? It's always {rname}...
- Am I boring? You only talk to {rname}...
- Did I upset you? It's just {rname} now...
- It's a little lonely when you're always with {rname}...
- It's lonely when you're with {rname}...
- I miss you when you're with {rname}...
- It gets quiet without you...

@rule romance.jealous.plain.energetic
on romance
when act=jealous q=plain tone=energetic
- Hey! You hang out with {rname} every day now! What about me?!
- {rname} every day?! What about me?!
- Hey! Me too! Not just {rname}!
- {rname} again?! Hang with me!
- It's always {rname}, {rname}, {rname}! I'm fun too, you know!
- {rname}, {rname}! I'm fun too!
- Always {rname}! Pick me sometimes!
- Enough {rname}! My turn!
- No fair! {rname} gets you all to herself!
- {rname} hogs you! No fair!
- {rname} gets you all day! Unfair!
- Share! {rname} keeps you!

@rule romance.jealous.plain.cool
on romance
when act=jealous q=plain tone=cool
- You and {rname} are always together lately. I'm not complaining. I'm observing.
- You and {rname}, constantly. Just observing.
- Always with {rname}. An observation.
- {rname}, daily. Noted.
- I'm glad you and {rname} get along. ...Don't forget the rest of us.
- Good that you and {rname} get along. Remember others.
- {rname} is fine. Don't forget us.
- Don't forget the rest of us.
- You've been busy. With {rname}, mostly.
- Busy. With {rname}.
- You've been with {rname}.
- {rname} has your time.

@rule romance.jealous.plain.teasing
on romance
when act=jealous q=plain tone=teasing
- Oh, you remembered me? I thought {rname} had adopted you.
- Remembered me? I thought {rname} kept you.
- Oh, you escaped {rname}?
- {rname} let you off the leash?
- Is {rname} that interesting? Should I be worried?
- Is {rname} that great? Should I worry?
- {rname}, huh? Am I being replaced?
- What's so special about {rname}?
- Let me guess, {rname} was busy today so you came to me?
- {rname} was busy, so me?
- Second choice after {rname}?
- Oh, {rname} wasn't free?

# ================= asked for something, not now (Consent decides; the private invitation stays in C#) =================
@rule romance.notnow.date.gentle
on romance
when act=notnow q=date tone=gentle
- Ah... not this time, I'm sorry. Maybe another week?
- Not this time, sorry. Another week?
- I'm sorry, I can't. Maybe later?
- Not this weekend... sorry.

@rule romance.notnow.date.energetic
on romance
when act=notnow q=date tone=energetic
- Aww, I can't this time! Ask me again, okay?
- Can't this time! Ask again!
- Aww, no! Next time!
- Busy! Ask later!

@rule romance.notnow.date.cool
on romance
when act=notnow q=date tone=cool
- ...Not this week.
- ...No. Another time.
- ...Not now.

@rule romance.notnow.date.teasing
on romance
when act=notnow q=date tone=teasing
- This weekend? Hm. No. Try again later.
- This weekend? No. Later.
- Hm, no. Try later.
- Not this time.

@rule romance.notnow.confess.gentle
on romance
when act=notnow q=confess tone=gentle
- W-wait... I don't think I'm ready to hear it yet...
- Wait... I'm not ready to hear it...
- Please... not yet...
- Ah... not yet...

@rule romance.notnow.confess.energetic
on romance
when act=notnow q=confess tone=energetic
- Eh?! W-wait! Not yet! I'm not ready!
- Wait! Not yet!
- Hold on! Not ready!
- Eh?! Wait!

@rule romance.notnow.confess.cool
on romance
when act=notnow q=confess tone=cool
- ...Not yet. Let's get to know each other first.
- ...Not yet.
- ...First, know me.
- ...Too soon.

@rule romance.notnow.confess.teasing
on romance
when act=notnow q=confess tone=teasing
- Hold that thought. Not yet.
- Hold that thought.
- Not yet.
- Save it.

@rule romance.notnow.lunch.gentle
on romance
when act=notnow q=lunch tone=gentle
- Sorry... I already promised someone today.
- Sorry, I promised someone.
- I already have plans today... sorry.
- Not today... sorry.

@rule romance.notnow.lunch.energetic
on romance
when act=notnow q=lunch tone=energetic
