- Not today! Tomorrow!
- Can't! Tomorrow, okay?
- Nope! Tomorrow!

@rule romance.notnow.lunch.cool
on romance
when act=notnow q=lunch tone=cool
- ...Not today.
- ...Busy.
- ...Another day.

@rule romance.notnow.lunch.teasing
on romance
when act=notnow q=lunch tone=teasing
- Lunch? Not today. Ask me tomorrow.
- Not today. Tomorrow.
- Tomorrow, maybe.
- Ask tomorrow.

@rule romance.notnow.home.gentle
on romance
when act=notnow q=home tone=gentle
- I'm sorry, I have somewhere to be after class...
- Sorry, I have somewhere to be.
- I'm busy after class... sorry.
- I can't today, sorry.

@rule romance.notnow.home.energetic
on romance
when act=notnow q=home tone=energetic
- Can't today! Errands, ugh!
- Can't! Errands!
- Busy today!
- Nope! Stuff to do!

@rule romance.notnow.home.cool
on romance
when act=notnow q=home tone=cool
- ...I'm going alone today.
- ...Alone today.
- ...Busy.
- ...Not today.

@rule romance.notnow.home.teasing
on romance
when act=notnow q=home tone=teasing
- Not today. I've got plans.
- Plans. Sorry.
- Busy.
- Not today.

@rule romance.notnow.later.gentle
on romance
when act=notnow q=later tone=gentle
- Ah... not right now, sorry. Maybe later?
- Not right now... later?
- Sorry, not now.
- Maybe later?

@rule romance.notnow.later.energetic
on romance
when act=notnow q=later tone=energetic
- Hmm, not now! Later, later!
- Not now! Later!
- Later!
- Hmm, later!

@rule romance.notnow.later.cool
on romance
when act=notnow q=later tone=cool
- ...Not now.
- ...Later.
- ...No.

@rule romance.notnow.later.teasing
