# ================= you looked like you had something to say, then stayed =================
@rule romance.breakup.stay.gentle
on romance
when act=breakup q=stay tone=gentle
- ...Hm? Is something wrong?
- ...Is something wrong?
- ...Hm? What's the matter?
- ...Are you okay?

@rule romance.breakup.stay.energetic
on romance
when act=breakup q=stay tone=energetic
- What? What's with that face?
- What's with that face?
- What?!
- Why the face?!

@rule romance.breakup.stay.cool
on romance
when act=breakup q=stay tone=cool
- ...You looked serious for a second.
- ...Serious look.
- ...You look serious.
- ...What?

@rule romance.breakup.stay.teasing
on romance
when act=breakup q=stay tone=teasing
- What's that look for?
- What's that look?
- Why so serious?
- Hm? That face?

# ================= wary: she wanted to take it and something held her back =================
@rule romance.wary.no.gentle
on romance
when act=wary q=no tone=gentle
- ...Th-thank you. I don't know what to say yet.
- ...That makes me happy. I just... can't answer properly.
- ...I-I'll think about that, okay?
- ...You're making me nervous. In a good way.

@rule romance.wary.no.energetic
on romance
when act=wary q=no tone=energetic
- Eh?! Um! I... I'll answer later, okay?!
- Wait, wait, I'm not ready for that! ...But thanks!
- Whoa, my heart! Ask me again sometime!
- Ahh, I don't know what to say!

@rule romance.wary.no.cool
on romance
when act=wary q=no tone=cool
- ...I heard you. Give me time.
- ...Not yet. But I heard you.
- ...I'll remember that.
- ...Hm. Ask me again sometime.

@rule romance.wary.no.teasing
on romance
when act=wary q=no tone=teasing
- Oh? Sweet. ...I'll let you know.
- Mm, flattery. Maybe it'll work someday~
- Cute. Ask me again later.
- Almost got me there.

# ================= what you tell her =================
@rule me.romance.compliment.effort
on me.romance
when act=compliment lvl=effort
- You've been working really hard lately. It shows.
- I noticed how much effort you put in. That's amazing.
- You never coast, do you? I respect that.

@rule me.romance.compliment.club
on me.romance
when act=compliment lvl=club
- I heard you're doing great at {club}.
- You're really good at your club stuff, you know?
- People keep talking about you at {club}. In a good way.

@rule me.romance.compliment.smart
on me.romance
when act=compliment lvl=smart
- You always explain things so clearly.
- You're really sharp, you know that?
- You make hard things sound easy.

@rule me.romance.compliment.looks
on me.romance
when act=compliment lvl=looks
- You look really nice today.
- Your hair looks great like that.
- That smile of yours is pretty great.
